<title>USA: Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Yields on the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices fell this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday, Oct 4, was 5.70 percent, down six basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.60 percent, down six basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.95 percent, down six basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.70%   5.76%   10/3/96</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.60%   5.66%   10/3/96</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.95%   6.01%   10/3/96</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
